  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a9cd2aab",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "These graphs show what we would expect, that as employees report being more satisfied or having better work/life balance, they are less likely to leave.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Age vs Attrition"
