  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "06fa832a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can see that younger employees are generally more likely to leave, but this starts to reverse around age 45. Retirement is likely a factor, but also employees are likely changing jobs for more senior roles. \n",
    "\n",
