  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "375427fd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "There is a fairly weak correlation between how far someone lives from work and if they are likely to leave. It is interesting that the trend appears to level off so it seems like it's only a factor within a certain range.\n",
